        {
          "code": "build_step_required",
          "fact": "packages/promptr/index.ts re-exports dist/src/extension/index.mjs; dist/ is not in the tree, so npm ci and npm run build must run in packages/promptr before the first start."
        },
        {
          "code": "host_module_dependency",
          "fact": "packages/promptr/package.json lists @earendil-works/pi-tui at 1.0.2 under dependencies because the companion process needs it; Pi 1.0.2 prints one warning for it at each start. For the built files Pi loads a second copy of pi-tui from packages/promptr/node_modules. The kit pins Pi 1.0.3 with pi-tui ^1.0.3, so the two copies differ: pi-tui 1.0.3 changed the default keys of Home and End. The effect on key handling is not verified."
        },
        {
          "code": "placeholder_defaults",
          "fact": "The kit copy has neutral placeholder defaults for the tracker host, the tracker owner and the OpenKnowledge origin; set GITEA_HOST, GITEA_OWNER and OPENKNOWLEDGE_ORIGIN in the shell that starts Pi, or the tracker dialog offers a repository that does not exist."
        },
        {
          "code": "private_renderer_adapters",
          "fact": "The sidebar uses private Pi renderer adapters. Not verified: a session with a model."
        },
        {
          "code": "automatic_dispatch_path_unverified",
          "fact": "packages/promptr/src/extension/index.mts calls requestHandoff with automatic set; the kit has not verified its switch."
        },
        {
          "code": "kit_test_missing",
